ock_reason":null,"sub_issues_summary":{"total":0,"completed":0,"percent_completed":0},"issue_dependencies_summary":{"blocked_by":0,"total_blocked_by":0,"blocking":0,"total_blocking":0},"body":"### Tested versions\n\nreproducible in 4.4-beta1\nnot reproducible in 4.4-dev7\n\n### System information\n\nGodot v4.4.beta1 - Windows 10 (build 19045) - Multi-window, 2 monitors - Vulkan (Mobile) - dedicated NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070 (NVIDIA; 32.0.15.6636) - AMD Ryzen 9 3950X 16-Core Processor (32 threads)\n\n### Issue description\n\nDebug export has text_server ERROR in minimal project.\nMRP is Node2D main_scene with empty script attached.\nNode type not relevant. In bigger projects the error will repeat many times.\n\nwindows:\n```\nGodot Engine v4.4.beta1.official.d33da79d3 - https://godotengine.org\nVulkan 1.3.289 - Forward Mobile - Using Device #0: NVIDIA - NVIDIA GeForce RTX 4070\n\nERROR: U_FILE_ACCESS_ERROR\n   at: (modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp:7144)\nERROR: U_FILE_ACCESS_ERROR\n   at: (modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp:7144)\n```\n\nlinux:\n```\nGodot Engine v4.4.beta1.official.d33da79d3 - https://godotengine.org\nVulkan 1.3.255 - Forward Mobile - Using Device #0: Intel - Intel(R) Graphics (ADL GT2)\n \nERROR: U_FILE_ACCESS_ERROR\n   at: _spoof_check (modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp:7144)\nERROR: U_FILE_ACCESS_ERROR\n   at: _spoof_check (modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp:7144)\n```\n\n### Steps to reproduce\n\nimport MRP\n\"export with debug\" (tested: windows, linux)\nrun the resulting _console.exe or .x86_64\n\n### Minimal reproduction project (MRP)\n\n[44b1expdebug.zip](https://github.com/user-attachments/files/18454066/44b1expdebug.zip)","closed_by":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.co